WEBVTT

NOTE
Selphie's introduction FMV — she is found on a rocky hillside near Dollet.
Duration: approximately 14 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Selphie stands on rocky boulders against a pink and purple sunset sky.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Selphie leaps with arms outstretched, spinning joyfully on the hillside.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
Close-up: Selphie crouches and lands among vegetation on the ground.
